    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ canonicas þær seo ar sy þæt he beodern ⁊ slæpern habban magan, healdan heora mynster mid clænnesse, swa heora regol tæce, oððon riht is þæt þolige þære are se þe þæt nelle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And canons, wherever their property admits of their having a refectory and a dormitory, shall maintain celibacy in their foundation, as their rule prescribes; otherwise it is right that he who refuses to do so should forfeit his endowment.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[Not in D]</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
